  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conditional loan to Swedfund for thier investment in shares in Amsco. Amsco develops private sector companies through education and giving  managment support. The loan will be paid back to Sida when Swedfund   sells their investment. Any return on shares will be paid to Sida.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Villkorsl&#xe5;n via swedfund f&#xf6;r deras f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;rv i AMsco. Amsco har i       uppgift att utveckla privatsektorf&#xf6;retag genom att tillhandah&#xe5;lla     ledningsresurser och utbildning. L&#xe5;net &#xe5;terbetalas sida n&#xe4;r swedfund  s&#xe4;ljer sin investering. Avkastning betalas till Sida i det fall det   uppst&#xe5;r.</narrative>
